<<PlayBackgroundMusic Exciting_1>>
 
 

<<SetBGSprite KohliwadaGround>>

<<SetCharacterExpression "Ramu" "Neutral">>
Ramu: Captain, good—you came. I'm teaching you the spine of batting—no secrets, just honesty.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "SeriousWithBat">>
Raju: Ok.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Ramu" "Serious">>
Ramu: There are five things you'll carry every time you pick up the bat—not heavy, but important. 

<<SetCharacterExpression "Ramu" "Serious">>
Ramu: One—Eyes: see before you decide, greed makes you blind. 

<<SetCharacterExpression "Ramu" "Serious">>
Ramu: Two—Feet: quiet feet, quick mind—don't rush, settle first. 

<<SetCharacterExpression "Ramu" "Serious">>
Ramu: Three—Hands: gentle guide, not angry hammer—let the bat speak. 

<<SetCharacterExpression "Ramu" "Serious">>
Ramu: Four—Timing: we can't waste anything—wait for your moment. 

<<SetCharacterExpression "Ramu" "Serious">>
Ramu: Five—Temper: runs come and go, but manners stay.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "SeriousWithBat">>
Raju: Eyes, feet, hands, timing, temper... five.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Ramu" "Serious">>
Ramu: Good—now three rules: respect the bat, respect the bowler, and respect yourself.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "SeriousWithBat">>
Raju: What about winning?

<<SetCharacterExpression "Ramu" "Serious">>
Ramu: Winning is a side-effect of good habits—we practice habits, the rest follows.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Ramu" "Serious">>
Ramu: Picture the dust, the chalk line, the noise—keep your promises and remember who you're playing for.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "SeriousWithBat">>
Raju: For us.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Ramu" "Serious">>
Ramu: For us—alright captain, sleeves up, words end here.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Ramu" "Neutral">>
Ramu: Ready? Step out with a steady heart.

<<HideAllCharacters>>
<<EndEvent>>
